  "worked_solution": "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Tu & =[\\begin{aligned}x & y & x \\\\ x & -y & x \\\\ -x & -y & x\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ 0 \\\\ -x\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}x\\cdot x+y\\cdot 0+x\\cdot (-x) \\\\ x\\cdot x+(-y)\\cdot 0+x\\cdot (-x) \\\\ (-x)\\cdot x+(-y)\\cdot 0+x\\cdot (-x)\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}+0-{x}^{2} \\\\ {x}^{2}+0-{x}^{2} \\\\ -{x}^{2}+0-{x}^{2}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -2{x}^{2}\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$",
